menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_CHILD_PROMPT_PROFILE
    bool "Enable local child prompt profile"
    default n
    depends on FEATURE_CONFIG_STORE
    help
        Persist the child's age tier and mirror the guardian content allowlist
        so the device can gate local prompts and label a voice session with the
        active content level. The platform child profile remains authoritative.

endmenu
